        /// `<Grammar>::GRAMMAR_PROFILE` to disambiguate when
        /// multiple grammars coexist in the same test file —
        /// the module-scope `pub use ...::*` would otherwise
        /// collide on the unqualified `GRAMMAR_PROFILE` name.
